CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FOne of the world's most loved
OL,7,Fcomedies, The Full Monty, was filmed
OL,8,Fin Sheffield 30 years ago in 1996.
OL,10,FThe film is the story of laid off
OL,11,Fsteelworkers finding purpose, pride
OL,12,Fand the courage to bare all.
OL,14,FIt was distinctly a Yorkshire
OL,15,Fproduction and, on its release, became
OL,16,Fthe highest-grossing British film of
OL,17,Fall time - introducing Sheffield, and
OL,18,Fthe story of Britain's industrial
OL,19,Fdecline, to audiences around the world.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FOvernight, the limelight was thrust
OL,7,Fupon the Steel City. The film helped
OL,8,Fredefine the city's image and
OL,9,Fcontinues to shape its cultural
OL,10,Fidentity.
OL,12,FTo mark the anniversary, ITV Calendar
OL,13,Fhas been spoken to a number of people
OL,14,Fbehind the movie.
OL,16,FWatch the full report here:
OL,18,F"It changed our lives, all of us that
OL,19,Fwere involved", said Yorkshireman
OL,20,Factor Steve Huison, from Leeds, who
OL,21,Fplayed Lomper.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FSteve had previously only worked in
OL,7,Fcommunity theatre, visiting schools
OL,8,Fand centres around Yorkshire.
OL,10,F"To suddenly go from packing a van
OL,11,Foutside of school with squashed chips
OL,12,Fon the bottom of your set - to
OL,13,Factually being on a film set - it was
OL,14,Fvery different.
OL,16,F"I didn't expect the amount of success
OL,17,Fthat it got but I knew it would work,
OL,18,Fright from the first draft that we
OL,19,Freceived, was, in my opinion, a
OL,20,Fperfect script.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F"You get invited to all the festivals,
OL,7,Fthe film awards, got flown out to
OL,8,FAmerica a few times in first class
OL,9,FBritish Airways with a bed - next to
OL,10,FRod Stewart snoring!
OL,12,F"I think we filmed it in 6 or 7 weeks,
OL,13,Fsomething like that. The city was
OL,14,Fbuzzing at the time and Sheffield had
OL,15,Fsuch a feel about it then."
OL,17,FAnd it was the mood, and moment,
OL,18,FSheffield found itself in that had
OL,19,Finspired a young, aspiring
OL,20,Fscreenwriter.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FSimon Beaufoy would later pen major
OL,7,FHollywood blockbusters like 127 Hours,
OL,8,FEverest and work on the The Hunger
OL,9,FGames films.
OL,11,FIn 2006, Simon won an Oscar, BAFTA and
OL,12,FGolden Globe for writing Slumdog
OL,13,FMillionaire.
OL,15,FBut it began in the Steel City -
OL,16,Fthough Simon was born elsewhere in
OL,17,FYorkshire, in Keighley.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F"It was the first film I wrote. It was
OL,7,Fabout a lot of people I knew and it
OL,8,Fwas about an area, Sheffield, that I
OL,9,Freally fell in love with.
OL,11,F"It's sort of weird love letter to
OL,12,FSheffield people, and that was the
OL,13,Ffirst place I wanted it to be set."
OL,15,FIt was a low-budget film by Hollywood
OL,16,Fstandards, with $3 million from Fox
OL,17,FSearchlight to make it.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F"It was a film that nobody really
OL,7,Fwanted to make to begin with. We
OL,8,Freally struggled to get the finance
OL,9,Ftogether to make it.
OL,11,F"Harvey Weinstein wanted to finance it
OL,12,Fif we set it in Buffalo, Texas and
OL,13,Fbrilliantly the producer, Alberto,
OL,14,Fsaid: 'No, we want to set it in
OL,15,FSheffield.'
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F"The American company Fox Searchlight,
OL,7,Fwho were about to close cause they
OL,8,Fwere losing money, threw what was for
OL,9,Fthem the lunch money at it and they
OL,10,Fsaid do your worst... and Searchlight
OL,11,Fare still going strong now.
OL,13,F"The fact that nobody was interested
OL,14,Fin it meant that we could cast who we
OL,15,Fwanted... we were flying under the
OL,16,Fradar: there was no expectation."
OL,18,FWhat with the iconic ending scene and
OL,19,Fsubject matter, it is often easy to
OL,20,Fforget the darker moments of the film.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FNamely, characters come together after
OL,7,Fbeing made unemployed due to the
OL,8,Fclosure of Sheffield steelworks - with
OL,9,Fsome experiencing crises of
OL,10,Fconfidence, poverty and another
OL,11,Fattempting suicide.
OL,13,FSimon explains: "It's only as funny as
OL,14,Fit is because it's as sad as it is ...
OL,15,FIf you go through what's in the film,
OL,16,Fthere's about 3 minutes of taking your
OL,17,Fclothes off.
OL,19,F"It captures that very Yorkshire thing
OL,20,F- the worse things get, the better the
OL,21,Fjokes get.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F"Having been in Sheffield and watching
OL,7,Fthe pride - male pride - being taken
OL,8,Fapart with a wrecking ball in the way
OL,9,Fthat the heavy industry had been just
OL,10,Fdecimated up there, leaving a whole
OL,11,Fgeneration of men out of work,
OL,12,Fwandering around that city with
OL,13,Fnothing to do and no future.
OL,15,F"I thought if I could turn it on its
OL,16,Fhead and say - this could be a moment
OL,17,Fof pride and that germ of an idea just
OL,18,Fcreated everything.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G10/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F"I was writing about problems that
OL,7,Fwould go away like male isolation, our
OL,8,Fkind of emotional hopelessness as men
OL,9,Fat sharing problems, and talking about
OL,10,Four feelings.
OL,12,F"30 years later, I thought, well,
OL,13,Fsurely men will have evolved, but
OL,14,Fguess what? The film is still relevant
OL,15,Fnow and everyone laughs still because
OL,16,Fit remains true."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G11/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FThe title was inspired by a visit to a
OL,7,Fclimbers' cafe in Derbyshire, where
OL,8,Fthe menu offered a 'Full Monty'
OL,9,Fbreakfast`meaning it came with
OL,10,Feverything.
OL,12,FSimon explains, "I remember thinking,
OL,13,F'that's exactly what I want for the
OL,14,Ffilm: these guys are going all the
OL,15,Fway'.
OL,17,F"I thought that every filmed I wrote
OL,18,Fafter that would have the same impact.
OL,19,FIt took me ten years to realise that
OL,20,Fwasn't going to happen every time!"
OL,26,@oD@Nrr
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G12/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FAway from those who made the film, it
OL,7,Falso impacted the people who lived
OL,8,Fthere.
OL,10,FHundreds of locals were used as
OL,11,Fextras. In fact, the people of
OL,12,FSheffield were thanked in one of the
OL,13,FBAFTA acceptance speeches for being
OL,14,F"such great hosts."
OL,16,FAmong those who was key in
OL,17,Ffacilitating the production was Ann
OL,18,FBentley, who ran the Shiregreen
OL,19,FWorking Men's Club alongside her
OL,20,Fhusband.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G13/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33414
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FThe production company visited several
OL,7,Flocal clubs in the area to find the
OL,8,Fbest fit for filming the interior
OL,9,Fstrip club scenes and settled on the
OL,10,FShiregreen for it's older look and
OL,11,F"character".
OL,13,FNot many adaptions were needed, but a
OL,14,Fstage was built with prominent
OL,15,Fcurtains for the iconic final dance.
OL,17,FAnn explains: "I never expected when
OL,18,Fwe took the club on for that film to
OL,19,Fbecome part of our era there, and an
OL,20,Fabsolutely amazing part of my life.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G14/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33415
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F"The club was really busy afterwards
OL,7,Fwith people coming round. It boosted
OL,8,Four takings for a number of years.
OL,10,F"The amount of people coming round to
OL,11,Fhave a look - it never stopped and it
OL,12,Freally helped boosted the clubs taking.
OL,14,F"Years later, lots of charities came
OL,15,Fround to the club to do their own
OL,16,Fstrip dances to raise money."
OL,18,FRecalling the final strip scene, Ann
OL,19,Fsays: "It was around 7:30am and they
OL,20,Fclosed all the doors so that nobody
OL,21,Fcould get in there at all."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G15/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33416
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FThe Shiregreen has closed since and
OL,7,Fthe building fallen into disrepair,
OL,8,Fdespite a campaign to try and save it.
OL,10,F"I did try to get it going ... it's
OL,11,Fvery sentimental to me. I lived there
OL,12,Ffor 16 years and it was where I met my
OL,13,Fhusband.
OL,15,F"I never thought it would close.
OL,16,FAlthough I did get over a 1000
OL,17,Fsignatures to get it re-opened."
OL,19,FThe film made an immediate impact and
OL,20,Fembedded itself into the national
OL,21,Fculture almost upon arrival.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G16/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33417
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FEven the then Prince, now King Charles
OL,7,FIII, recreated the famous dance from
OL,8,Fthe queueing scene while visiting
OL,9,FSheffield just a year after the film
OL,10,Fwas released.
OL,12,F"It was absolutely brilliant, and he
OL,13,Falso did it really well," says Simon,
OL,14,F"it was the last thing anyone was
OL,15,Fexpecting him to do.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G17/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33418
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F"Many years later, I met the Queen and
OL,7,Fshe said, 'What do you do?', and I
OL,8,Fsaid well, a while ago I wrote a film
OL,9,Fcalled The Full Monty and she looked
OL,10,Fme in the eyes and went, 'Oh, that was
OL,11,Fyou!'
OL,13,F"So she knew all about it, so clearly
OL,14,Fthey'd all sat down and watched it!"
OL,16,FThe film's distinctly British outlook
OL,17,Fof enduring tough times with humour
OL,18,Fcontinues to resonate with audiences
OL,19,Ftoday.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G18/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33419
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,FSo much so, actor and dancer Kevin
OL,7,FClifton stars in a new stage
OL,8,Fadaptation which will kick off in
OL,9,FSheffield at the Lyceum Theatre next
OL,10,Fyear - debuting on 15 January 2027
OL,11,Fthen touring the UK and Ireland until
OL,12,FJuly 2027.
OL,14,FHe told ITV Calendar: "I'm really
OL,15,Fexcited about it. I remember when it
OL,16,Fcame out and it just felt, it felt
OL,17,Flike the biggest film to come out in
OL,18,Fyears when it happened.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G19/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33420
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785795487
OL,3,CHow a small-budget Yorkshire comedy
OL,4,Cbecame a global phenomenon
OL,6,F""Everything feels right about it. The
OL,7,FFull Monty was part of my growing up
OL,8,Fand is one of the greatest British
OL,9,Ffilms of all time.
OL,11,F"As a Northerner, it's a whole part of
OL,12,Four culture. It did dawn on me though
OL,13,Fwhen I got it... I do have to actually
OL,14,Fget naked on stage!"
OL,16,FThe writer Simon also added that he is
OL,17,F"really excited that it's back on tour
OL,18,Fagain and starting in Sheffield, which
OL,19,Fis going to be wild - it's picked up a
OL,20,Fwhole new audience."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G20/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
